  m_cutscenelinesbeginning:
  - You are a lawyer, who was struck down into hell
  - Why? Well because you did a really bad job of course!
  - You got your clients, convicted of the most minor of crimes, onto death row due
    to your incompetence
  - Your nickname in the media was
  - OFFENSE LAWYER
  - Climb, and try and escape hell.
  m_cutscenelinesend:
  - So, you have prevailed, and escaped
  - Well Done, you may now become revived
  - 'and continue your duty '
  - of being the
  - OFFENSE LAWYER
